<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεκτον-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>practised</i> or <i>skilled in building</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				460b
			</span></i>: as Subst., <i>a good carpenter</i> or
				<i>builder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				443c
			</span></i>, etc.; as opp. to a smith (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκευτικός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.1.7
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>joiners' work,
			carpentry</i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">Pl.,
				<u>Plt.</u>280c</span></i>, al.; as
			opp. to smiths' work (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκεία, ἡ
			χαλκευτική</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				324e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				3.100
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν</span>
			<i>skill in carpentry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				416d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for a joiner</i> or <i>carpenter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Epin.</u>
					975c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					5.1.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.829
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPHerm.</u>
				p.77
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τ</span>.
				<i>joinery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMich.Zen.
				38.55
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφάλαιον
				τεκτονικοῦ</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.374.140
			</span></i>.</div>
